    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, A. Ibathul RauffHakeem, Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, on the recommendation of the UniversityGrants Commission, do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1518/15of October 09, 2007 (as last amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2023/32 of June 14, 2017),which specifies the Faculties and Departments of the University of Jaffna, Sri Lanka which is deemed, by virtue ofthe provisions of Section 139 of the aforesaid Act, to be a University established under Section 21 of the said Act, asfollows :-",
